ive her roughly a nine-in-ten chance of winning. With no reliable general-election polling available, the forecast leans on fundamentals and expert consensus, which point to a Democratic gain of mid-to-high single digits, though a July poll suggesting a close race keeps some uncertainty in play.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9032, "margin": 8.24}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.8754, "margin": 7.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8706, "margin": 7.5}]}